OL,3,GNEWSAMore than half a million flock to
OL,4,AHull Fair
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 550,000 people attended this
OL,7,Fyear's Hull Fair, according to the city
OL,8,Fcouncil.
OL,10,FThe centuries-old annual event, which
OL,11,Fis based in Walton Street and known as
OL,12,Fone of the largest travelling fairs in
OL,13,FEurope, took place from 9-17 October.
OL,15,FHumberside Police said only four
OL,16,Farrests were made during the event,
OL,17,Fincluding for assault and being drunk
OL,18,Fand disorderly. Forty-two dispersal
OL,19,Forders were also handed out.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
