OL,3,GNEWSAMore than half a million flock to
OL,4,AHull Fair
OL,5,
OL,6,FHull City Council leader Mike Ross
OL,7,Fsaid: "We think over half a million
OL,8,Fpeople came along this year and as far
OL,9,Fas we know it all went swimmingly."
